Abstract = {The 2012 National Farmers' Sports Games will be held in Nanyang, which
   brings many opportunities for the construction of the stadium and
   gymnasium in the city. On the basis of analyzing the sustainable
   development strategies of the palaestra construction in Nanyang, the
   authors put forward the concept of the whole life cycle administration
   which ensures sustainable development of the palaestra. This research
   concerns testifying feasibility before the construction, creating
   multiple funds and efficiently use the funds, making sufficient use of
   inhering resources, paying attention to the overall design of the urban
   sports construction, improving team administration of sports facilities,
