Abstract = {Effective self-management can decrease up to 50\% of heart failure (HF)
   hospitalizations. However, self-management by patients with HF remains
   poor. We describe the development and usability testing of an
   interactive digital e-health game (IDEG) for older patients with HF in
   Central Texas, USA. Majority of the participants (5 out of 6) who
