Abstract = {Campus tourism gradually becomes an attractive proposition in the
   tourism market. It is also an indispensable part of urban and cultural
   tourism. In this paper, the author makes a summary about campus tourism
   in Chinese colleges and universities from the perspectives of tourism
   resource and development. She analyses the positive and negative
   influences of promoting campus tourism. From the aspect of
   sustainability, the author also illustrates the principles involved in
   campus tourism development. Furthermore, possible projects are
   demonstrated based on the current situation of Chinese colleges and
   universities, which is followed by the recommendations on developing
   sustainable campus tourism.},
