   CHINA, 2008},
Organization = {Shanxi Prov Assoc Risk Management; Shanxi Univ Finance \& Econ},
Abstract = {The eutrophia of Chinese surface water bodies, lakes, offshores and
   rivers, is serious in southern China. Although a huge sum of money was
   cost to control any result has been achieved hardly. It is because the
   root of eutrophia was not griped. In this paper the key of control
   Chinese surface water body eutrophia is studied using analytic hierarchy
   process (AHP). The results showed that the most main factor of leading
   Chinese surface water body eutrophia is the discharging of urban sewage.
   And 70\% urban sewage comes of water-closet and 90\% nitrogen and
   phosphorus in urban sewage comes of urine. Therefore, the key of control
   surface water body eutrophia is to rebuild residents' lavatories. In
   this paper writers presented that the water-closers were rebuilt into
   the latrines of stool and urine collected and treated separately, the
   quantity of wastewater, nitrogen and phosphorus will be reduced
   immensely, the eutrophia of Chinese surface water bodies will be
   controlled and the more economic benefit can be obtained, too.},
