   the 21st Century (UT 97), ACQUASPARTA, ITALY, SEP, 1997},
Organization = {Univ Perugia; Wessex Inst Technol},
Abstract = {This paper developed a model to analyze the influence of introducing
   road pricing schemes to convert car commuters to public transportation
   by applying the covariance structural analyses. Surveys were performed
   by interviews and questionnaires to companies and employees in Osaka
   city. The model estimation was conducted based on these data.
   Calculation by using this model showed that road pricing with 500 yen is
   needed to convert about 10 \% of car commuters to public transportation
   in Osaka city.},
