Note = {1st International Conference on Energy and Environmental Protection
   (ICEEP 2012), Hohhot, PEOPLES R CHINA, JUN 23-24, 2012},
Organization = {Inner Mongolia Univ},
Abstract = {The affordable housing is not allocated by the market and therefore the
   value of it can not be promoted by any effective market competition.
   Because of a lack of value evaluation in implementing the affordable
   housing project, the mechanism of value evaluation should be introduced
   into the process of making and implementing policies for the affordable
   housing project. To satisfy the public demand, the affordable housing
   embodies government's social responsibility and thus the preliminary
   function is to realize its social value. A priority should be
   steadfastly given to the evaluation of its social value. By means of
   social value evaluation, we can make full use of its value-oriented
   function and hopefully maximize the social value of the affordable
   housing project.
   As an important livelihood project to improve the living conditions of
   low-income urban residents, the affordable housing project is of greatly
   political and social significance for improving people's livelihood and
   social harmony and stability. Simultaneously, it will give rise to a
   strong driving effect on some relevant industries such as the steel
   industry, building materials industry and construction industry and so
   on. What's more, the consuming environment and conditions of urban
   residents can be largely ameliorated, which will favorably expand the
   future relevant consummation. Concluded from the above, at the
   background of the complicated international economics and politics, an
   increasing effort to construct affordable houses is the right choice in
   the aspects of time and opportunities to promote economic and social
   development.},
