Organization = {Diponegoro Univ, Sch Postgraduate Studies},
Abstract = {One of the village that get first priority in slums handling in in
   Semarang City based on mayor decree of Semarang's number 050/801/2014 is
   Jatibarang Village. According the Ministry of Public Works through the
   KOTAKU (Kota Tanpa Kumuh) Program, in 2017 Jatibarang Village received
   funding for road and drainage construction. This research is to evaluate
   the slum reduction of road and drainage construction in a neighborhood.
   The method of research is quantitative and comparative through data
   calculation on 2 (two) criteria after handling and comparied with
   baseline data. Based on the results of the research it can be seen that
   the slum handling of 2 (two) slum criteria did not give big impact to
   the slum value that is 40 before the handling and 30 after handling with
   the difference of 10 points. The results of this research indicate that
   there is still a need for handling slum reduction in this area. It is
   also necessary to evaluate the value of slum periodically of slum areas
   that have been set in order to know the changes that occur, involving
   the local community in the maintenance of settlement environment is
   necessary as well, so it is expected that the slum reduction increases,
   insteade of decreasing..},
