Abstract = {This paper presents a study recently made to establish guidelines for
   the south expansion of the Porto Metropolitan Area light-metro system in
   the short-, the medium, and the long-term. The Porto Metropolitan Area,
   in northen Portugal, has approximately 1,200,000 inhabitants and is one
