   Urbanization - Take Henan Province as an example},
Booktitle = {URBANIZATION AND LAND RESERVATION RESEARCH},
Year = {2009},
Pages = {55-58},
Note = {International Conference on Urbanization and Land Reservation Research,
   Tianjin, PEOPLES R CHINA, SEP, 2009},
Organization = {Tianjin Univ Commerce; Tianjin Assoc Social Sci Circle},
Abstract = {The optimized allocation of land resources was the important problem in
   the process of urbanization. Using qualitative and quantitative methods,
   this paper clearly gives an analysis of the relationship between
   urbanization and optimized allocation of land resources, and the basic
   principles for allocating the land resources based on the thinking of
   sustainable development strategy. We should formulate a scientific
   overall plan of utilization and urban plan, make land be used more
   intensively, control the land Of construction strictly and protect
   cultivated land effectively. These methods can promote the development
   of the process of urbanization and the economy, the society and the
   environment harmoniously. Taking Henan Province as example, this paper
   discusses the main problems of the process of urbanization and land use,
   and puts forward countermeasures and suggestions for the optimized
   allocation of land resources in the process of urbanization.},
