Abstract = {Urbanization is an important sign and inevitable trend. During the
   urbanization process, many cities in our country have faced more and
   more serious problems in resources, environment and other aspects. We
   should make use of the recycling economy developing theory to guide our
   urbanization process and improve the sustainable capabilities of cities.
