   ENVIRONMENTAL SUSTAINABILITY (CCGEES 2020)},
Series = {E3S Web of Conferences},
Year = {2021},
Volume = {228},
Note = {International Conference on Climate Change, Green Energy and
   Environmental Sustainability (CCGEES), ELECTR NETWORK, DEC 18-20, 2020},
Abstract = {In China, colleges and universities bear the important responsibility of
   cultivating high-quality talents. The quality, ability and work
   performance of university teachers are more and more concerned by the
   whole society, including colleges and universities. Emotional labor of
   college teachers refers to the process in which teachers control and
   express their emotions according to the requirements of the school.
   Emotional intelligence is related to emotional labor, and emotional
   labor strategy is the means to optimize the emotional labor process.
   College Teachers' emotional labor strategies include five basic
   strategies: self-awareness, self-regulation, self motivation, empathy,
   and social skills. It can stimulate college teachers' real emotions and
   deep acting behaviors, help to avoid job burnout and enhance their sense
   of professional identity and happiness. From the perspective of
   emotional labor, it is of great significance to study the working state
   of young teachers and put forward the strategies to improve their
   working enthusiasm, whether it is of great significance to the career
   development of young teachers, the improvement of teaching and
   scientific research quality and the cultivation of talents.},
