Abstract = {There is a lack of references on the attributes which were considered,
   by different authors, for their alphanumeric databases (DB) associated
   with the preparation of engineering geological maps using Geographic
   Information Systems (GIS). The past experiences on the utilization of
   geotechnical DB have revealed several discrepancies between the
   specialists who conceived the DB and the needs of the technicians and
   decision makers that could utilize such information. On the left bank of
   Tagus river, facing Lisbon, Almada is a major urban center, that has
   continuously grown since the sixties. The authors present the
   geotechnical information chosen to implement the Almada Municipality
   Geotechnical Relational Data Base Management System, the Geo-Almada Data
   Bank, that results from a joint collaboration between researchers from
   the New University of Lisbon - Civil Engineering Department, and some
   technical staff of the Almada Town Council, especially the Municipal
