   Chinese Neuromodulat Soc; Chinese Minister Sci \& Technol; IEEE Computat
   Intelligence Soc; Int Neural Network Soc; Springers Lecture Notes
   Artificial Intelligence; Hainan Med Univ; Hainan Province Enterprise
   Directors Assoc; Hainan Province Enterprise Confederat; Haikou Convent
   \& Exhibition Ind; Beijing Qingyang Sci \& Technol Co Ltd; Beijing
