   Geophys; Chinese Acad Sci; Engn Technol Press},
Abstract = {Basing on the monitoring data of water quality of LiuJiazhuang section
   and the analysis results of 4 years, applying fuzzy comprehensive
   evaluation model, according to (Environmental quality standard for
   surface water)) to establish the relevant subjection functions, the
   quality evaluation of surface water in LiuJiazhuang section is made in
   this paper. The result shows that the change about the water quality in
   LiuJiazhuang is not obvious, which belongs to the II Grade and III Grade
   water standard, and the conditions of water quality are better. At the
   same time we should take effective monitoring measures of water quality
   and methods, set up and improve the water quality monitoring networks
   for the regular routine monitoring and emergency monitoring, adopt a
   good way in the rational utilization of water resources, protect the
   health of people, seek the sustainable development of society, economy,
   and environment, and make use of water resources and water environment
   forever.},
