   European Commiss Hong Kong \& Macao; CSR Asia},
Abstract = {Due to the polluters pay principle, the main method with which we deal
   with the pollution produced by enterprises is to charge emissions fees.
   However, there is a long way to go from theory to practice. In practice,
   we face difficulties for not have enough and necessary information about
   the optimized emission standard. This paper tries to identify the
   optimized emission quantities through value engineering approach. The
   function and value of the environment elements have been analyzed
   comprehensively in order to determine the optimized costs for
   environment factors and the optimized emission quantity. According to
   the ``cost-benefit{''} curve, enterprises should control their emissions
   spontaneously in order to maximize their social and economic value.},
