Abstract = {Based upon origin and destination studies in the Ahvaz area that is
   divided in to 37 zones. Trips in the zones have been calculated by the
   use of present methods. A study on the distribution of trips and
   tendency trip lines shows that land-use in the city area is unfavorable
   and change is required in the longer term. In this paper we study a
   comprehensive analysis of trips between zones, and suggest that better
   communication could be achieved from different zones towards the city
   center. In this research, 1995 is taken to the present year, and 2010 is
   taken to be a future prediction year (Design year).},
