Abstract = {Air4EU is an FP6 European project with the major aim of providing
   recommendations on methodologies for the spatial assessment of air
   quality on local, urban and regional scales. The emphasis is on
   methodologies that combine monitoring and modelling and on spatial
   assessment for regulatory purposes, i.e., the EU daughter directives.
   The recommendations coming from Air4EU are intended as guidance for
   authorities involved in air quality assessment at the city, national and
   European levels as well as institutes involved in air quality research
   and application. This paper provides some highlights from the
   recommendations and case studies that emerged from the project.},
